  "content": "\n\n<p>《Create: Refined Storage Recipes》是一款簡單的模組，用於更改「Refined Storage」模組的合成配方。</p>\n<p>本模組已收錄於&nbsp;<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/modpacks/create-lets-create\" rel=\"nofollow\">Create:letsCreate</a> 整合包&nbsp;中。</p>\n<p>本模組使用「Create」模組的組件，將所有「Refined Storage」的合成配方替換為符合「Create」風格的配方。</p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1062293/description_b36fd9f4-b3c4-4fb2-bc0a-0076300cbfab.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1062293/description_dc16b4bb-24d5-4595-a0de-03f9d19da4f2.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1062293/description_e5ef43dd-96d2-4495-8afa-c01cf5ce1469.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1062293/description_5f047256-ee90-4857-a839-9ca2b368d8eb.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1062293/description_c4305c84-4feb-48e7-aead-dbeb0c526c5e.png\" alt=\"\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1062293/description_9a3040a9-10b1-4ba9-9ecd-a50528a7594a.png\" alt=\"\"></p>\n<p>部分範例：</p>\n<p>&nbsp;<strong>Create Style for Refined Storage</strong> 資源包，讓「Refined Storage」呈現「Create」風格&nbsp;</p>\n<p>資源包：<a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-style-for-refined-storage\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://www.curseforge.com/minecraft/texture-packs/create-style-for-refined-storage</a></p>\n<p>亦可於 <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcreate-refined-storage-recipes\" rel=\"nofollow\">Modrinth</a> 取得</p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp; &nbsp;</p>\n<h1 style=\"text-align:center\"><span style=\"text-decoration:underline\"><strong>感謝我們的贊助商</strong></span></h1>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><strong>感謝 ZAP-HOSTING！使用優惠碼 Reggarf-1047 可享全店訂單 8 折！</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252fcreateletscreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://zap-hosting.com/createletscreate</a></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\"><a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fzap-hosting.com%252fcreateletscreate\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1062293/description_e47a592d-1e68-4525-bb6f-d047705da15a.png\" alt=\"\"></a></p>",
